    family-names: OSS Team
    affiliation: SciForge Project
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: https://gitcode.com/GewisLab/SciForge-OSS
repository-code: https://gitcode.com/GewisLab/SciForge-OSS.git
abstract: >-
  A pure Skill-driven AI Scientist framework for ANY scientific
  domain. SciForge-OSS is a Markdown-based framework that enables
  AI agents to conduct end-to-end scientific research across
  physics, mathematics, computer science, medicine, economics,
  education, materials science, earth science, and more.
keywords:
  - AI for Science
  - AI Scientist
  - Scientific Research Automation
  - DAG-based Research
  - Skill-driven Framework
